WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.094
From Peking University and Google,

00:00:02.174 --> 00:00:06.315
CITransNet is a context-integrated transformer for
auction design.

00:00:06.395 --> 00:00:10.343
It maximizes seller revenue while staying
incentive-compatible,

00:00:10.423 --> 00:00:12.325
discovers asymmetric solutions,

00:00:12.405 --> 00:00:16.290
and generalizes to auction sizes it never saw
during training.
